    "created_at": "2019-01-10T00:56:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-10T00:56:48Z",
    "body": "A `<dfn lt>` (empty `lt` attribute) marks it as not a real definition. But then you can't link to it at all. I prefer just using `<b id>` and a manual `<a>` if you're doing pure examples.",
